0985015d681d7ce8f690c91430705398  # ***.***.***-25 - 46x, README.md and 21 more
3eeee576a4d5d1c66a3d608e30bb562d  # ***.***.***-35 - 1x, detect/br/cpf_test.go

# --- generic-api-key ---
# Base64 module hashes in go.sum, not keys. This is the upstream corpus scoring entropy on something that is entropy by design, and it is why M5 exists.
e031c6a2053adb8c44799d00badf6623  # *****+**************+*****************/***o= - 1x, go.sum
76551615c0ebd13131fd41cbed6e26e4  # ***/*********************+****************w= - 1x, go.sum

